      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "49",
        "title"
      ],
      "originalHash": "f1cb842bee315e26ee0d780458384d507dad40b659224b0aa715ae391a3c6fd8",
      "sourceFileHash": "424ba93fe70047a554127295cd9bd0aa3018bbb32d69d5b5dbf20e80ba72a694",
      "originalText": "縁の引力",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "3d81629ed0b30d296554c7f65a48ae1f",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904200-Byerley-Turk/love-342.kojo",
      "key": "49",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "49",
        "lines",
        0
      ],
      "originalHash": "de22f1b2fb2e71dee25e8696c13efca2e547ed3659c2ff906be8cdf6adc01c5e",
      "sourceFileHash": "424ba93fe70047a554127295cd9bd0aa3018bbb32d69d5b5dbf20e80ba72a694",
      "originalText": "導かれるように、誰かが小さく呼ぶように。気づいたとき、%YOU% は三女神の像を仰いでいた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "3cc319954cd9d4c23896670da97df3f2",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904200-Byerley-Turk/love-342.kojo",
      "key": "49",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "49",
        "lines",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "fcb31249e2889c823f8a1590f80503c562e95c189d3ef41a71bd54d59e71f01e",
      "sourceFileHash": "424ba93fe70047a554127295cd9bd0aa3018bbb32d69d5b5dbf20e80ba72a694",
      "originalText": "万年変わらぬ石像は、黙して前方を見ている。まるで、二つの世界が平行しているかのようだ。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "0179e4e3333b6c548ba29395a918049f",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904200-Byerley-Turk/love-342.kojo",
      "key": "49",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "49",
        "lines",
        2
      ],
      "originalHash": "b88486d0d333cb3967278d44cdb9283ca280a8f54a342e248643f79bc3569841",
      "sourceFileHash": "424ba93fe70047a554127295cd9bd0aa3018bbb32d69d5b5dbf20e80ba72a694",
      "originalText": "だが、奇妙な感触は消えない。誰かが %YOU% の手を取り、前方を示しているように。%YOU% は三女神の像を見つめ、考え込む。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "b2ee96d3d47e20ebdba59f498b70dd6c",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904200-Byerley-Turk/love-342.kojo",
      "key": "49",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "49",
        "lines",
        3
      ],
      "originalHash": "2a62d80589ba59ab2b2680180d7e5980df08c9757e44cf5c51b7b7210564a1e2",
      "sourceFileHash": "424ba93fe70047a554127295cd9bd0aa3018bbb32d69d5b5dbf20e80ba72a694",
      "originalText": "微風が吹き、伸ばした掌に一枚の葉が落ちる。細かな脈が、何か告げようとしているかのようだ。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "00aee5be62e0e13c3efbd5e346305025",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904200-Byerley-Turk/love-342.kojo",
      "key": "50",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "50",
        "title"
      ],
      "originalHash": "ce9a9446f8e9e9645da3cb069b5c2c4ac225d59483792110549138f4db64a9bc",
      "sourceFileHash": "424ba93fe70047a554127295cd9bd0aa3018bbb32d69d5b5dbf20e80ba72a694",
      "originalText": "願いの叶う夜",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "d6d8014ac10620c1c57ca960647f00c5",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904200-Byerley-Turk/love-342.kojo",
      "key": "50",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "50",
        "lines",
        0
      ],
      "originalHash": "47c15bbd0aae919949831807e0ebc19e2dcded229f17fb9d2fb697b9bc5384a1",
      "sourceFileHash": "424ba93fe70047a554127295cd9bd0aa3018bbb32d69d5b5dbf20e80ba72a694",
      "originalText": "奇妙な影が、ゆっくりと %YOU% のベッドへ攀じ上り、両手で %YOU% の手を押さえる。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "f6fb7f4c6720f60e47c5ae7fad749515",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904200-Byerley-Turk/love-342.kojo",
      "key": "50",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "50",
        "lines",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "b57a89f3f435cfe0f8c72d80713688241cc6b0bbc8d881ef4dc01f8e4c4b08ff",
      "sourceFileHash": "424ba93fe70047a554127295cd9bd0aa3018bbb32d69d5b5dbf20e80ba72a694",
      "originalText": "夢の中、赤い瞳の持ち主は豊かな身を重ね、%YOU% を下に固定する。いまにも獲物へ牙を立てる獣のように。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "696a24612dc63975d15e12baef8c0968",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904200-Byerley-Turk/love-342.kojo",
      "key": "50",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "50",
        "lines",
        3
      ],
      "originalHash": "ea0a1161d84f80ea602f43b2b1c361db4073ddd8de00816ca3d44f8c2d2d2d83",
      "sourceFileHash": "424ba93fe70047a554127295cd9bd0aa3018bbb32d69d5b5dbf20e80ba72a694",
      "originalText": "だが、この朦朧とした夢のなかで、%YOU% の意識は妙に澄んでいる。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "7687c7ba0b7548ada5786f4deacde7f9",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904200-Byerley-Turk/love-342.kojo",
      "key": "50",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "50",
        "lines",
        4
      ],
      "originalHash": "374ec24a55d40294382e079b6f6fd452977e947fffb52f6e9248975801144a0c",
      "sourceFileHash": "424ba93fe70047a554127295cd9bd0aa3018bbb32d69d5b5dbf20e80ba72a694",
      "originalText": "赤い瞳、深い茶色の髪、右目に一条の傷跡。そのウマ娘が、いま %YOU% の身体を押さえ、発情した獣のように頬を舐め、次いで唇へ口づけを落とす。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "b82139541ac86fa85b3eb4b725e7082d",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904200-Byerley-Turk/love-342.kojo",
      "key": "50",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "50",
        "lines",
        6
      ],
      "originalHash": "ea9711fe483fa2a7384eb52b37b24e102591739795724f233f11f5131b79b797",
      "sourceFileHash": "424ba93fe70047a554127295cd9bd0aa3018bbb32d69d5b5dbf20e80ba72a694",
      "originalText": "やがて霧が広がり、朦朧の中、ウマ娘の衣が剥がれ落ち、完璧な曲線が %YOU% の眼前に現れる。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "4422349913fbfaa67980d4b53e5b0253",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904200-Byerley-Turk/love-342.kojo",
      "key": "50",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "50",
        "lines",
        7
      ],
      "originalHash": "ca37375a8b42e96b4d576dc0496bced91973eb212914956f381bc95d55ad0d69",
      "sourceFileHash": "424ba93fe70047a554127295cd9bd0aa3018bbb32d69d5b5dbf20e80ba72a694",
      "originalText": "彼女は %YOU% の両手を押さえ、身体を上から下まで値踏みする。情欲に占領された双眸は得意げで、%YOU% は当然のように己のものであると言わんばかりだ。豊かな身体が身を屈め、%YOU% と絡み合う。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "5246222e1b930990ed085669d1c56761",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904200-Byerley-Turk/love-342.kojo",
      "key": "50",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "50",
        "lines",
        8,
        "content"
      ],
      "originalHash": "2c975664aa162cd96042b030da5ce9fd35d18d827f20b7a735f7b303343f3809",
      "sourceFileHash": "424ba93fe70047a554127295cd9bd0aa3018bbb32d69d5b5dbf20e80ba72a694",
      "originalText": "主導を奪う（神の胤を宿らせる）",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "71b37de1c70f5d88c9040cee987d7161",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904200-Byerley-Turk/love-342.kojo",
      "key": "50",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "50",
        "lines",
        8,
        "lines",
        0,
        "lines",
        0
      ],
      "originalHash": "aed03da9220a9ab6b4e30a75510aaa5b24a1c89307f4b0ac0b2918ebff45a5fc",
      "sourceFileHash": "424ba93fe70047a554127295cd9bd0aa3018bbb32d69d5b5dbf20e80ba72a694",
      "originalText": "夢の中であっても、これほど気高く、強気なウマ娘を前にしても、%YOU% に主導を手放すつもりはなかった。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "1d711af8379fb09cb491e7293ebe0138",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904200-Byerley-Turk/love-342.kojo",
      "key": "50",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "50",
        "lines",
        8,
        "lines",
        0,
        "lines",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "234b10e4da437d11c3fd3c88c7dfc0d40423d03a9e9c8f6f1a75ae580680c7c7",
      "sourceFileHash": "424ba93fe70047a554127295cd9bd0aa3018bbb32d69d5b5dbf20e80ba72a694",
      "originalText": "押さえられた手を力ずくで解き、逆に彼女をベッドへ押し伏せる。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "bf09d4b1cebde987d56f6c3953ca4ac8",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904200-Byerley-Turk/love-342.kojo",
      "key": "50",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "50",
        "lines",
        8,
        "lines",
        0,
        "lines",
        2
      ],
      "originalHash": "f39811ab1b1748f76fd150af4ee92eba5fda66522bd8a45bfd72f7bab90b97b2",
      "sourceFileHash": "424ba93fe70047a554127295cd9bd0aa3018bbb32d69d5b5dbf20e80ba72a694",
      "originalText": "その荒々しさに、下のウマ娘は明らかに予期していなかった。激しく抗うが、%YOU% の男根がその秘所へ入った瞬間、まるで逆らうことを忘れた子羊のように、荒い行いを受け入れる。呼吸は、%YOU% の動きにつれてさらに粗くなった。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "d0df2ecd5fcccc2055c031374e7f2b17",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904200-Byerley-Turk/love-342.kojo",
      "key": "50",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "50",
        "lines",
        8,
        "lines",
        0,
        "lines",
        3
      ],
      "originalHash": "39d465a0d6e72cbafbeffece9db590917021f43e8b9c7861d3797166aa885e60",
      "sourceFileHash": "424ba93fe70047a554127295cd9bd0aa3018bbb32d69d5b5dbf20e80ba72a694",
      "originalText": "荒い突きが心の守りを開き、気高い赤い瞳のウマ娘は、%YOU% の意のままに姿勢を変え、荒い行いに屈する。抗うはずの手は今や力なく、%YOU% は柔らかくなった耳を掴み、彼女を快楽の器として用いる。種を受ける器のように、注がれるのを待っている。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "880b725a69e3b8133da7709d064fd780",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904200-Byerley-Turk/love-342.kojo",
      "key": "50",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "50",
        "lines",
        8,
        "lines",
        1,
        "lines",
        0
      ],
      "originalHash": "d70ecb83ce775f98e1ece71faf5ba9323877edc841d62a8d372a27176b46c635",
      "sourceFileHash": "424ba93fe70047a554127295cd9bd0aa3018bbb32d69d5b5dbf20e80ba72a694",
      "originalText": "%YOU% の内に、甚だしい冒涜の思いが芽吹く。眼前の気高く強気なウマ娘を押し伏せ、征服したとき、その顔はどんなに美しいだろうか——だが、荒唐無稽な幻想を摘み取る間もなく、身体に熱と快感が走る。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "92d8e7c7c85a40f1012c9372b7d5b353",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904200-Byerley-Turk/love-342.kojo",
      "key": "50",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "50",
        "lines",
        8,
        "lines",
        1,
        "lines",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "1bb35519ad48cef5ebb3315482d3b6ef103cae409679e5e1fa943afa41a7a341",
      "sourceFileHash": "424ba93fe70047a554127295cd9bd0aa3018bbb32d69d5b5dbf20e80ba72a694",
      "originalText": "先ほどまで %YOU% に覆い被さっていたウマ娘は、いま頭を股間に埋め、いつのまにか生えた、太く力強い男根を銜え、動かしている。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "1aa5aa581b023ab97abc50553ff63525",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904200-Byerley-Turk/love-342.kojo",
      "key": "50",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "50",
        "lines",
        8,
        "lines",
        1,
        "lines",
        2
      ],
      "originalHash": "c9a1618627411a8ae5c3febac3499cd97c312bd46884c945429adc10d0659715",
      "sourceFileHash": "424ba93fe70047a554127295cd9bd0aa3018bbb32d69d5b5dbf20e80ba72a694",
      "originalText": "視線に気づいたのか、男根を放し、舌で鈴口をそっと撫でたあと、頬をそれに寄せ、優しく、少し得意げな笑みを %YOU% へ向けた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "60a9956ae60d655a37f0c20160796f1d",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904200-Byerley-Turk/love-342.kojo",
      "key": "50",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "50",
        "lines",
        8,
        "lines",
        1,
        "lines",
        3
      ],
      "originalHash": "1dd1255a0ced06b1b1aaa99d9e242ed047bfe8bb5cfc7506b0df4e59c99f9104",
      "sourceFileHash": "424ba93fe70047a554127295cd9bd0aa3018bbb32d69d5b5dbf20e80ba72a694",
      "originalText": "もはや欲の火に耐えられず、%YOU% は彼女を下に固定する。身体が重なり、唇と歯が交わるなか、余裕に満ちていた表情が徐々に弱くなっていく。そして腰を送り、ウマ娘が授けたその男根を、濡れた秘所へ突き入れた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "62bd498fff10f5a8e51b083c4c57d4f3",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904200-Byerley-Turk/love-342.kojo",
      "key": "50",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "50",
        "lines",
        8,
        "lines",
        1,
        "lines",
        4
      ],
      "originalHash": "5b165ff79c98a712fa6d3af4180600fbd23bc2b5b8aa1aac5bef802c1f573b75",
      "sourceFileHash": "424ba93fe70047a554127295cd9bd0aa3018bbb32d69d5b5dbf20e80ba72a694",
      "originalText": "彼女は、男根が秘所へ入るのを、少し慌てた目で見る。激しい抵抗はほとんどなく、赤い瞳のウマ娘は従順な子羊のように、%YOU% の行いのすべてを受け止めた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "f561903f569f2671f45d2d0e031ac8a2",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904200-Byerley-Turk/love-342.kojo",
      "key": "50",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "50",
        "lines",
        9,
        "content"
      ],
      "originalHash": "a5fe85135a29b420cbddda15f1928d22b366c8a09e5034e6b949f10947e8146d",
      "sourceFileHash": "424ba93fe70047a554127295cd9bd0aa3018bbb32d69d5b5dbf20e80ba72a694",
      "originalText": "味わう（%FUCKMEBUTTON%）",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "8eba0fb40c07eef76761a1c0ce2185b0",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904200-Byerley-Turk/love-342.kojo",
      "key": "50",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "50",
        "lines",
        9,
        "lines",
        0
      ],
      "originalHash": "3c68ab6811af71c37291ba428383a57c88b63a25932bebb9e26c2471005298b4",
      "sourceFileHash": "424ba93fe70047a554127295cd9bd0aa3018bbb32d69d5b5dbf20e80ba72a694",
      "originalText": "%YOU% の思いを察したように、気高いウマ娘の下に、突然、太く長く力強い男根が現れる。その猛々しい匂いを嗅いだだけで、%YOU% の全身が熱を帯び、抗う気力すら起きない。覆い被さるウマ娘の動きに、%YOU% は素直に従う。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "39ed9917b868a7ed305f3a43f2b22f35",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904200-Byerley-Turk/love-342.kojo",
      "key": "50",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "50",
        "lines",
        9,
        "lines",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "e48f600eb5fcc459d7ec392de0e5bd4a52d0b973f44305d75d590979d80c3160",
      "sourceFileHash": "424ba93fe70047a554127295cd9bd0aa3018bbb32d69d5b5dbf20e80ba72a694",
      "originalText": "身体が重なる。彼女は腰を抱え、すべての動きを掌握し、%YOU% に割り込む余地をまったく与えない。まるで、%YOU% は彼女の男根を収める器でしかないかのように。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "bdbc2d9bf626d9bb060f4e1aa70f828d",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904200-Byerley-Turk/love-342.kojo",
      "key": "50",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "50",
        "lines",
        9,
        "lines",
        2
      ],
      "originalHash": "3932e3aeb2ebcc91cf4dee00dae586429abc6be6f9715ace76cd90ea49aeff05",
      "sourceFileHash": "424ba93fe70047a554127295cd9bd0aa3018bbb32d69d5b5dbf20e80ba72a694",
      "originalText": "だが徐々に、そのリズムだけでは足りなくなり、自ら腰を捻って、彼女と共に踊り始める。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "9b370c613615cc82010e56bc2199c1bc",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904200-Byerley-Turk/love-342.kojo",
      "key": "50",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
