      ],
      "originalHash": "743fa70f88a938a5dde2e6efbe8262fa23d02a95137535f93481ed754db3dece",
      "sourceFileHash": "424ba93fe70047a554127295cd9bd0aa3018bbb32d69d5b5dbf20e80ba72a694",
      "originalText": "抗いと征服の循環のなか、赤い瞳のウマ娘は %YOU% の動きに屈し、共に果てる。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "f012803baaf9a6881a7ef83875f1ea47",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904200-Byerley-Turk/love-342.kojo",
