        10,
        "content"
      ],
      "originalHash": "15253084d1276da646d7347d88f440be02a610150badcee06c6562b1e39a5bd2",
      "sourceFileHash": "424ba93fe70047a554127295cd9bd0aa3018bbb32d69d5b5dbf20e80ba72a694",
      "originalText": "眠り続ける",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "bf0d642bf4b6b10b7d730a669137febe",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904200-Byerley-Turk/love-342.kojo",
      "key": "50",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "50",
        "lines",
        10,
        "lines",
        0
      ],
      "originalHash": "dfa1ac9ad7a53e6e670170049155514f377757ea5e961efbbfaed2fb309ea48c",
      "sourceFileHash": "424ba93fe70047a554127295cd9bd0aa3018bbb32d69d5b5dbf20e80ba72a694",
      "originalText": "これは夢だろう。当然のように、相手の動きを無視する。睡眠の時間は貴重だ——夢の中でも、%YOU% はそう自らに言い聞かす。赤い瞳のウマ娘は不満げだったが、やがて闇が再び湧き上がり、%YOU% は際限なく柔らかい闇へ沈み、安眠を抱きしめた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "7d959242620a7c5f0dbe84786b674297",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904200-Byerley-Turk/love-342.kojo",
      "key": "pray",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
