      "originalHash": "c658d9157475c359c5414db0fd5f631e3d020608a7a958a2b868db98b743cc3a",
      "sourceFileHash": "424ba93fe70047a554127295cd9bd0aa3018bbb32d69d5b5dbf20e80ba72a694",
      "originalText": "ああ……身体が、少し重い……昨夜の、奇妙な夢のせいだろうか。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "faa03a21e02c3bdf9f9803904e5833d6",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904200-Byerley-Turk/love-342.kojo",
